@WorkflowEngine_HostAddress = http://localhost:5164

### Create a workflow request
POST {{WorkflowEngine_HostAddress}}/api/workflow/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Budget Approval Request",
  "description": "Requesting approval for Q4 budget",
  "enrichmentData": {
    "amount": 50000,
    "department": "IT"
  }
}

### Get all workflow requests
GET {{WorkflowEngine_HostAddress}}/api/workflow/requests
Accept: application/json

### Get a specific workflow request (replace with actual ID)
GET {{WorkflowEngine_HostAddress}}/api/workflow/requests/YOUR_REQUEST_ID_HERE
Accept: application/json

### Approve a workflow request (replace with actual ID)
POST {{WorkflowEngine_HostAddress}}/api/workflow/requests/YOUR_REQUEST_ID_HERE/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvedBy": "John Doe",
  "comments": "Approved for processing",
  "actionData": {
    "priority": "high"
  }
}

### Reject a workflow request (replace with actual ID)
POST {{WorkflowEngine_HostAddress}}/api/workflow/requests/YOUR_REQUEST_ID_HERE/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rejectedBy": "Jane Smith",
  "reason": "Insufficient budget justification"
}

